# The virtualenv and the voices are the two things that must not be copied.
#
# `.venv` is 700+ MB of host-built CPython 3.12 packages — wrong path prefixes,
# wrong interpreter location, and rebuilt from requirements.txt inside the image
# anyway. `voices/` is ~123 MB of Piper weights that belong to the deployment,
# not the image: docker-compose.demo.yml bind-mounts them read-only so a new
# language is a download rather than a rebuild.
.venv
voices

__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

README.md
run.sh
